OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,6,     F2/5. Donald takes a tour of the
OL,7,     Fchurches of Purcell's London, and
OL,8,     Fexplores the impact on them of the
OL,9,     FEnglish Civil War and the Great
OL,10,     FFire of London.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FSoprano Sara Jakubiak. Theodore
OL,13,     FKoumartzis and Lina Palera play
OL,14,     Fthe Ancient Greek Lyre.
OL,15,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,16,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,19,     FByrd, Boulanger and Bernstein.
